{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730300/extras/Wishlist_now_transparent_shadow_man_version_2.gif?t=1749094212\" /><br><br>You came to Found Sheep Farm to find belonging, to build community, and to reconnect with your friend Sonia, whom you haven\u2019t seen in years. However, when you arrive, Sonia is nowhere to be seen: instead, you\u2019re greeted by four cute and charming farmers and their retreat director, Mr. Sheppard, who all deny Sonia ever existed.<br><br>Oh, well! Now you have the summer to bond with your fellow farmers, complete daily chores with the help of your new friends, explore the charming grounds of the farm, and\u2026 wait. What was that in the woods?<br><br>This \u201cdating sim\u201d psychological horror title gives you the choice: Will you pull the wool over your eyes to find true happiness, or will your pursuit of the truth make you the black sheep?<br><br><strong>WARNING: This game is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730300/extras/visual_novel.gif?t=1749094212\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unearth the Hidden Mysteries of the Farmstead</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730300/extras/Point_and_Click.gif?t=1749094212\" /><br>Explore the farm at night through point and click adventure, but be careful, you never know when someone is watching.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 10+ endings based on player choice.<br></li><li> Romance or bond with characters through <strong>dialogue</strong>, <strong>minigames</strong>, and <strong>choices</strong>.<br></li><li> Unlock 50+ steam achievements</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2730300?t=1749094212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.st